UID:10003456-1778522400-1778527800@www.calvarychurch.org
SUMMARY:Light in the Valley
DESCRIPTION:Light in the Valley exists to empower sufferers of chronic illness to use their brokenness to build godly character and to see themselves as someone with a greater purpose.\nAdvanced notice of your interest/participation is appreciated. \nAll inquiries will be kept confidential and sent directly to the group leader. \nEmail Contact: lightinthevalley@calvarychurch.org\nInterest Form\nhttps://calvarychurchpa.wufoo.com/forms/qiqzx0q1s9gd7g
URL:https://www.calvarychurch.org/calendar/light-in-the-valley-8/
CATEGORIES:Pastoral Care,Website Calendar
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Calvary Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T203000
DTSTAMP:20260508T234913
CREATED:20260205T165324Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260506T203252Z
UID:10006165-1778605200-1778617800@www.calvarychurch.org
SUMMARY:Abiding Hope
DESCRIPTION:Abiding Hope is a support group for Christian parents of a child that has embraced an LGBTQ+ identity. Our purpose is to come alongside parents by sharing the comfort of Jesus Christ and wisdom to navigate the relational waters of loving their child while holding on to the truth of scripture.\nAdvanced notice of your interest/participation is needed. \nAll inquiries will be kept confidential and sent directly to the group leader.\nEmail Contact: abidinghope@calvarychurch.org\nInterest Form\nhttps://calvarychurchpa.wufoo.com/forms/qiqzx0q1s9gd7g
URL:https://www.calvarychurch.org/calendar/abiding-hope-4/
CATEGORIES:Pastoral Care,Website Calendar
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Calvary Church
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260512T210000
DTSTAMP:20260508T234913
CREATED:20250911T163358Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260506T203252Z
UID:10003457-1778612400-1778619600@www.calvarychurch.org
SUMMARY:Grace & Hope
DESCRIPTION:Grace & Hope is a faith-based recovery support group meeting for those in recovery from alcohol or drug addiction. Grace & Hope is a meeting that shares the message that the God of the Bible is a loving\, caring\, and compassionate God and he wants to help you be successful in recovery and even over any struggle of life.\nGrace & Hope is held every Tuesday evening from 7:00-8:00pm at Calvary Church.\nRegistration is not required.\nContact Email: graceandhope@calvarychurch.org\nPhone Contact: Pastoral Care Team at (717) 509-6242 x278
URL:https://www.calvarychurch.org/calendar/grace-and-hope-35/
CATEGORIES:Pastoral Care,Website Calendar
END:VEVENT
